11:33-35; Heb 2:17; 4:15 Weep not. 8:52; Jer 31:15,16; Joh 20:13,15; 1Co 7:30; 1Th 4:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-7-14","title":"Luke 7:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>bier. or, coffin. Young. 8:54,55; 1Ki 17:21; Job 14:12,14; Ps 33:9; Isa 26:19; Eze 37:3-10 Joh 5:21,25,28,29; 11:25,43,44; Ac 9:40,41; Ro 4:17; Eph 5:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-7-15","title":"Luke 7:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>1Ki 17:23,24; 2Ki 4:32-37; 13:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-7-16","title":"Luke 7:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>a fear. 1:65; 5:8,26; 8:37; Jer 33:9; Mt 28:8; Ac 5:5,11-13 they. 2:20; Mt 9:8; 15:31; Ga 1:24 a great. 39; 9:19; 24:19; Joh 1:21,25; 4:19; 6:14; 7:40,41; 9:17; Ac 3:22,23 Ac 7:37 God. 1:68; 19:44; Ex 4:31; Ps 65:9; 106:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-7-17","title":"Luke 7:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>14; Mt 4:24; 9:31; Mr 1:28; 6:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-7-18","title":"Luke 7:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Mt 11:2-6; Joh 3:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-7-19","title":"Luke 7:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>John.When we remember the Baptist's solemn testimony to Christ, the sign from heaven, and the miraculous impulse which made him acknowledge Jesus the Messiah, we shall be constrained to think that he sent to Christ, not for his own satisfaction, but for that of his disciples.</p>\n<p>two. 10:1; Jos 2:1; Mr 6:7; Ac 10:7,8; Re 11:3 Art. Ge 3:15; 22:18; 49:10; De 18:15-18; Ps 110:1-4; Isa 7:14; 9:6,7; 11:1 Isa 40:10,11; 59:20,21; Jer 23:5,6; Da 9:24-26; Mic 5:2; Hag 2:7 Zec 9:9; Mal 3:1-3; 4:2; Joh 4:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-7-21","title":"Luke 7:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>plagues. 1Ki 8:37; Ps 90:7-9; Mr 3:10; 5:29,34; 1Co 11:30-32; Heb 12:6 Jas 5:14,15 evil spirits.[Pneuma poneros ,] are here clearly distinguished from bodily disorders.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-7-22","title":"Luke 7:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>Go. Joh 1:46 how. 21; 18:35-43; Job 29:15; Ps 146:8; Isa 29:18,19; 32:3,4; 35:5,6 Isa 42:6,7,16; 61:1-3; Jer 31:8; Mt 9:28-30; 21:14; Joh 9:30-33 Ac 26:18 the lame. Mt 15:30,31; Ac 3:2-8; 8:7; 14:8-10 the lepers. 5:12-15; 17:12-19 the deaf. Isa 43:8; Mr 7:32-37 the dead. 14,15; 8:53-55 to. 4:18; Zep 3:12; Jas 2:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-7-23","title":"Luke 7:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>2:34; Isa 8:14,15; Mt 11:6; 13:57,58; Joh 6:60-66; Ro 9:32,33 1Co 1:21-28; 2:14; 1Pe 2:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-7-24","title":"Luke 7:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>What. Mt 11:7,8 wilderness. 1:80; 3:2; Mt 3:1-5; Mr 1:4,5; Joh 1:23 A reed. Ge 49:4; 2Co 1:17-20; Eph 4:14; Jas 1:6-8; 2Pe 2:17; 3:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-7-25","title":"Luke 7:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>A man. 2Ki 1:8; Isa 59:17; Mt 3:4; 1Pe 3:3,4 are in. 2Sa 19:35; 1Ki 10:5; Es 1:3,11; 4:2; 5:1; 8:15; Mt 6:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-7-26","title":"Luke 7:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapt